; medium TRAP: SORT + SLICE 4 -> TOPK 4 over dl_amount DESC NL with ties written at different scales (980 vs 980.00, 1.0 vs 1.00); ties keep input order (S4/S5)
LOAD   id, deals.dl_id
LOAD   am, deals.dl_amount
LOAD   st, deals.dl_stage
SORT   p, am DESC NL
GATHER a, id, p
GATHER b, am, p
GATHER c, st, p
SLICE  a1, a, 4
SLICE  b1, b, 4
SLICE  c1, c, 4
OUT    a1, b1, c1
